config MMSTAT_TRACER
	tristate "Trace memory status periodically"
	depends on TRACING
	help
	  Periodic tracing of memory status.

	  Mmstat tracer will track memory usage periodically according to
	  indicated timer interval, which includes meminfo, buddy system,
	  hardware memory(if possible) and process memory.

config MMSTAT_PAGE_DETAIL
	tristate "Mmstat trace enhancement for page allocation"
	depends on MMSTAT_TRACER
	help
	  Add DMA/PAGE_FRAG allocation status.

	  Since direct page allocation is difficult to analysis, add two
	  sub categories DMA / PAGE_FRAG to divide direct page allocation
	  into hardware driver(DMA), network driver(page_frag) or others.
